title: PowerShell Shellcode/DLL Injection
id: 82b1b8d1-a673-4746-817d-2f9b643b1d30
status: experimental
description: Detects PowerShell performing process injection via Win32 API calls (VirtualAllocEx, WriteProcessMemory, CreateRemoteThread) or the PowerSploit Invoke-Shellcode/Invoke-DllInjection functions.
author: Alaris Global
references:
  - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1055/001/
logsource:
  product: windows
  category: process_creation
detection:
  selection:
    CommandLine|contains:
      - 'VirtualAllocEx'
      - 'WriteProcessMemory'
      - 'CreateRemoteThread'
      - 'NtCreateThreadEx'
  condition: selection
fields:
  - CommandLine
  - Image
  - ParentImage
falsepositives:
  - Legitimate low-level automation (rare)
level: high
tags:
  - attack.defense_evasion
  - attack.t1055.001
